  - link "View RTL Sidebar" [ref=e221]
  - heading [level=2]:
    - link "Changelog" [ref=e222]
  - heading [level=3]:
    - link "RTL Support" [ref=e223]
  - text: "If you're upgrading from a previous version of the  Sidebar  component, you'll need to apply the following updates to add RTL support:"
  - heading "Add prop to Sidebar component." [level=3]: "Add  dir  prop to Sidebar component."
  - text: "Add  dir  to the destructured props and pass it to  SheetContent  for mobile:"
  - generic [ref=e224]:
    - button "Copy" [ref=e225]
    - text: "function Sidebar({\n    side = \"left\",\n    variant = \"sidebar\",\n    collapsible = \"offcanvas\",\n    className,\n    children,\n+   dir,\n    ...props\n  }: React.ComponentProps<\"div\"> & {\n    side?: \"left\" | \"right\"\n    variant?: \"sidebar\" | \"floating\" | \"inset\"\n    collapsible?: \"offcanvas\" | \"icon\" | \"none\"\n  }) {"
  - text: "Then pass it to  SheetContent  in the mobile view:"
  - generic [ref=e226]:
    - button "Copy" [ref=e227]
    - text: "<Sheet open={openMobile} onOpenChange={setOpenMobile} {...props}>\n    <SheetContent\n+     dir={dir}\n      data-sidebar=\"sidebar\"\n      data-slot=\"sidebar\"\n      data-mobile=\"true\""
  - heading "Add attribute to sidebar container." [level=3]: "Add  data-side  attribute to sidebar container."
  - text: "Add  data-side={side} to the sidebar container element:"
  - generic [ref=e228]:
    - button "Copy" [ref=e229]
    - text: "<div\n     data-slot=\"sidebar-container\"\n+   data-side={side}\n    className={cn("
  - heading "Update sidebar container positioning classes." [level=3]
  - text: "Replace JavaScript ternary conditional classes with CSS data attribute selectors:"
  - generic [ref=e230] [scrollable]:
    - button "Copy" [ref=e231]
    - text: "className={cn(\n-   \"fixed inset-y-0 z-10 hidden h-svh w-(--sidebar-width) transition-[left,right,width] duration-200 ease-linear md:flex\",\n-   side === \"left\"\n-     ? \"left-0 group-data-[collapsible=offcanvas]:left-[calc(var(--sidebar-width)*-1)]\"\n-     : \"right-0 group-data-[collapsible=offcanvas]:right-[calc(var(--sidebar-width)*-1)]\",\n+   \"fixed inset-y-0 z-10 hidden h-svh w-(--sidebar-width) transition-[left,right,width] duration-200 ease-linear md:flex data-[side=left]:left-0 data-[side=right]:right-0 data-[side=left]:group-data-[collapsible=offcanvas]:left-[calc(var(--sidebar-width)*-1)] data-[side=right]:group-data-[collapsible=offcanvas]:right-[calc(var(--sidebar-width)*-1)]\","
  - heading "Update SidebarRail positioning classes." [level=3]
  - text: "Update the  SidebarRail  component to use physical positioning for the rail:"
  - generic [ref=e232] [scrollable]:
    - button "Copy" [ref=e233]
    - text: "className={cn(\n-   \"hover:after:bg-sidebar-border absolute inset-y-0 z-20 hidden w-4 -translate-x-1/2 transition-all ease-linear group-data-[side=left]:-end-4 group-data-[side=right]:start-0 after:absolute after:inset-y-0 after:start-1/2 after:w-[2px] sm:flex\",\n+   \"hover:after:bg-sidebar-border absolute inset-y-0 z-20 hidden w-4 ltr:-translate-x-1/2 rtl:-translate-x-1/2 transition-all ease-linear group-data-[side=left]:-right-4 group-data-[side=right]:left-0 after:absolute after:inset-y-0 after:start-1/2 after:w-[2px] sm:flex\","
  - heading "Add RTL flip to SidebarTrigger icon." [level=3]
  - text: "Add  className=\"rtl:rotate-180\" to the icon in  SidebarTrigger  to flip it in RTL mode:"
  - generic [ref=e234]:
    - button "Copy" [ref=e235]
    - text: "<Button ...>\n-   <PanelLeftIcon />\n+   <PanelLeftIcon className=\"rtl:rotate-180\" />\n    <span className=\"sr-only\">Toggle Sidebar</span>\n  </Button>"
  - text: "After applying these changes, you can use the  dir  prop to set the direction:"
  - generic [ref=e236]:
    - button "Copy" [ref=e237]
    - text: "<Sidebar  dir=\"rtl\" side=\"right\">\n  {/* ... */}\n</Sidebar>"
  - text: "The sidebar will correctly position itself and handle interactions in both LTR and RTL layouts."
